# What `make lab-image` / `make trainer-image` upload with `gcloud builds
# submit --ignore-file=images/images.gcloudignore .` (the root .gcloudignore
# ships service/ only, for the service build): the service tree, the lab and
# images/, without build output, data, runs, venvs, caches or env files. The
# images' own Dockerfile.dockerignore files narrow it further.
*
!service/
!service/**
!lab/
!lab/**
!images/
!images/**
service/bin/
lab/data/
lab/runs/
lab/.venv/
lab/.venv-train/
lab/.cache/
lab/unsloth_compiled_cache/
lab/.pytest_cache/
lab/.ruff_cache/
lab/*.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
**/.env
**/.env.*
